GatherSeed / CNCgAIde
Third-party components included in this repository

This file covers code that is *vendored* - checked in under this repository's
own tree rather than installed from a package index.  Packages installed by
`environment.yml` (torch, dgl, pythonocc-core, numpy, scipy, timm, networkx,
tqdm, PyYAML) carry their own licences through their distributions and are not
repeated here.


